{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19875","headline":"寒地百姓吟 · 孟郊","name":"寒地百姓吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"无火炙地眠，半夜皆立号。\n冷箭何处来，棘针风骚劳。\n霜吹破四壁，苦痛不可逃。\n高堂搥钟饮，到晓闻烹炮。\n寒者愿爲蛾，烧死彼华膏。\n华膏隔仙罗，虚遶千万遭。\n到头落地死，踏地爲游遨。\n游遨者是谁，君子爲郁陶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19875.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19875","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"徐培均"}